    },
    "Your body is still adapting to exogenous T. Aromatization patterns, energy fluctuations, and trough effects are all still emerging. Give it 3–6 months of consistent dosing to establish a clear pattern." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
